    "You came when the horn went.": "号角响起时你赶到了。",
    "You stayed past the first of it, and the Guild had the good of you.": "你坚持度过了最初阶段，行会因此受益。",
    "They put weight upon your place in the line, and it held.": "他们将重担压在你所在的队列位置上，而你守住了。",
    "The Guild has your name off the roll and keeps it there.": "行会已将你的名字从名册上登记，并一直保留在那里。",
    "They will ask for you by name at the muster after this one.": "下一次集会时，他们会点名召唤你。",
