    "+2 more on the second look.": "第二次查看时额外 +2。",
    "Spotted traps are stripped and sold,": "发现的陷阱会被拆解出售，",
    "Going down with a camp standing spends the camp, not the Infirmary trip.": "带着营地下行会消耗营地，而不是前往医务所。",
    "After a dream, Well-rested is +": "做梦后，充分休息获得 +",
    "Dream weapon chance doubles: 0.01% to 0.02% a long rest.": "梦境武器概率翻倍：每次长休由 0.01% 提高至 0.02%。",
    "extra dream roll every long rest.": "每次长休额外进行一次梦境判定。",
    "Well-rested lasts": "充分休息持续",
    "Pack capacity": "背包容量",
    "Breaths heal": "喘息恢复",
    "MP regenerates": "法力值恢复",
    "Debuffs last": "减益持续",
    "Abilities trigger": "能力触发",
    "Workings of seeing": "观测法术",
    "Workings of the stroke": "攻击法术",
    "Workings of the road": "道路法术",
    "Workings of mending": "治愈法术",
    "Workings against the old things": "对抗古物法术",
    "Workings of finding": "探索法术",
    "Workings of warding": "防护法术",
    "vampire spawn": "吸血鬼衍体",
    "unshriven monk": "未赦武僧",
    "A monstrous boar that dens in the lip of the sinkhole, grown bold and terrible": "盘踞陷坑边缘、变得凶猛可怖的巨型野猪",
    "For a span the wall bears your boots as the floor would, and the chasm goes hungry.": "片刻之间，墙壁像地面一样承托你的靴子，深渊只能空腹等待。",
    "Small lights of the fen, bound to service and ranged along the road ahead.": "沼泽的小灯，被束缚着列在前方道路两侧。",
    "What the beast meant to carry off it gives up instead, and gives up more than its share.": "野兽本想夺走的东西反而被迫交出，而且交出的超过了应有份额。",
    "All the weight of the body behind one stroke, guard be damned, and the beast wears it whole.": "将全身重量集中于一击，不顾防守，野兽完整承受这一击。",
    "Hand and foot in quick order, faster than the eye keeps count, until one lands where it must.": "手脚交替迅疾出击，快得让目光无法计数，直到一击命中要害。",
    "None asked and none given: the pace of the slaughter carries itself, and each kill feeds the next.": "无人请求，也无人施舍：屠杀的节奏自行延续，每次击杀都推动下一次。",
    "Fires as a hunt begins.": "狩猎开始时触发。",
    "That hunt is 20% faster.": "该次狩猎速度提高 20%。",
    "Fires on a kill.": "击杀时触发。",
    "+50% experience.": "+50% 经验值。",
    "+33% descent credit.": "+33% 下行进度。",
    "Fires as travel begins.": "旅行开始时触发。",
    "That leg is 20% faster.": "该路段速度提高 20%。",
    "Fires on a debuff taken.": "受到减益时触发。",
    "That debuff lasts 25% less time.": "该减益持续时间缩短 25%。",
    "Below half HP: may restore 5% of HP.": "生命值低于一半时：可能恢复 5% 生命值。",
    "On a boss kill: +10% speed for 60s.": "击杀首领后：速度提高 10%，持续 60 秒。",
    "Fires on an undead kill. Under a red moon every beast counts as undead.": "击杀亡灵时触发。红月下所有野兽都视为亡灵。",
    "+15% damage for 60s.": "+15% 伤害，持续 60 秒。",
    "+1.5 damage reduction for 60s.": "+1.5 伤害减免，持续 60 秒。",
    "Fires over the carcass.": "在尸骸上方触发。",
    "Fires as a blow lands.": "攻击命中时触发。",
    "That blow is 20% lighter.": "该次攻击伤害降低 20%。",
