    "The Simplicity example in Options no longer shows a line the game does not print.": "选项中的简明示例不再显示游戏不会打印的那一行。",
    "The beast's plate no longer shoves the panel beside it as fights start and end.": "战斗开始和结束时，野兽插图不再把旁边的面板顶开。",
    "The “turn sound on” prompt no longer returns for every adventurer. It asks once, after your first boss.": "“打开声音”提示不再为每位冒险者反复出现；在你首次击败首领后只询问一次。",
    "“Send for this one now” now works with a full party. The yard asks which hand steps down, and that hand keeps its study.": "“立即召回此人”现在支持满员队伍；营地会询问哪名帮手退下，被换下者保留其研习进度。",
    "The off-hand feat is now read by every fitting, so Auto-equip no longer strips your second weapon for a shield.": "现在每次装备适配都会读取副手专长，因此自动装备不再为了盾牌卸下你的第二把武器。",
    "The Armoury now hands over the second weapon, and toggling the off-hand feat re-fits your kit on the spot": "军械库现在会交付第二把武器；切换副手专长后会立即重新适配装备。",
    "The Red Hour wrote to the log many times a second. It writes once now.": "猩红时刻此前每秒多次写入日志，现在每秒只写一次。",
    "With Simple wording on, the school tooltip promised spell names and never showed them.": "开启简明措辞时，学派提示框承诺显示法术名称却始终不显示；现已修复。",
