    "When two spells were tied, the wrong one sat on top. The firing one sits on top now.": "两种法术并列时曾显示错误顺序；现在优先显示即将施放的法术。",
    "Clearing the wall before v1.6.2 never gave “The Hand That Walked Out”. It does now.": "在 v1.6.2 之前清空军械墙不会获得“走出的那只手”；现在会正常获得。",
    "Four set accessories had no description in the armoury book. They show their bonus now.": "四件套饰品过去在军械册中没有说明；现在会显示套装加成。",
    "Single-source items now say “and no other way” instead of “and off no other door”.": "单一来源物品现在显示“且没有其他途径”，不再显示错误的“且没有其他门”。",
    "The four new pets could not eat. Now they eat.": "四种新宠物此前无法进食，现在可以了。",
    "The cave-shrike, road-mole, magpie and mist-hare ate nothing and never grew.": "洞穴尖啸鸟、道路鼹鼠、喜鹊和雾兔此前不吃东西也不成长。",
    "Pets already on your Roll start growing from the next stroke, leg or chest.": "宠物名册中已有的宠物会从下一次击打、道路路段或宝箱开始成长。",
    "A pet's door now opens the moment it is earned, instead of at the next kill.": "宠物栏现在会在获得宠物的瞬间开启，不必等到下一次击杀。",
    "A fully grown mist-hare shows a full bar at its tenth growth, which is its cap.": "完全成长的雾兔在第十次成长时显示满格，这就是成长上限。",
    "A fast chronicle spent seconds on road legs and earned almost no descent for them.": "快速编年史曾在道路路段上浪费数秒，却几乎没有获得下行进度。",
    "New items, pets, a hireling, and a folk and an origin to unlock. Details on Steam.": "新增物品、宠物、雇员、种族和出身等待解锁。详情请见 Steam。",
    "Every folk, trade and origin gift is lifted. Details on Steam.": "所有种族、职业和出身赠礼均已提升。详情请见 Steam。",
    "A kinder Infirmary, earlier camps, and a tidier Options.": "疗养院更加友善，营地更早出现，选项界面也更整洁。",
